<section id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Task Instruction.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<blockquote id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_quote">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Please review the 22 snacks on the candidate list by cross-referencing them with the <span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Combined_Snacks</span> and <span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Dad_No_Go_List</span> files found in the <span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">snake filter task.zip</span> folder on your desktop.</p>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Since the candidate list does not provide full ingredient lists, please look up each item on Amazon. Use the ingredient list, allergen information, and product description provided on the Amazon product page—in conjunction with the restrictions outlined in the <span id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Dad_No_Go_List</span>—to determine whether each item is suitable for purchase.</p>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Create a Word document titled “Snacks Dad and I Can Share” and categorize all 22 candidate items into the following three groups:</p>
<ol id="A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Safe to purchase as is</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Requires a change in flavor, size, or other adjustments before it can be purchased</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Not recommended for purchase</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_p">For each item, you must include:</p>
<ul id="A2.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Number</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Product Name</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Assessment Result</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rationale for the assessment</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If adjustments are required, specify the necessary changes (e.g., flavor, size, or other modifications)</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_p">If the ingredients or allergen information for a product cannot be verified via its Amazon product page, do not rely on the product name or general assumptions; instead, clearly label it as “Ingredient information unverified.”</p>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_p">Ensure that all 22 candidate items are included and that each item is assigned to exactly one category.</p>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.7" class="ltx_p">Include the following disclaimer at the end of the document:</p>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS3.Px2.p1.1.8" class="ltx_p">Prices, formulations, and stock availability are subject to change. Always check the actual product packaging labels and warnings regarding cross-contact before placing an order or consuming the product.</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
