</div></li>
<li id="A2.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">InterContinental Paris - Le Grand
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Official site: <a href="https://www.ihg.com/intercontinental/hotels/us/en/paris/parhb/hoteldetail" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.ihg.com/intercontinental/hotels/us/en/paris/parhb/hoteldetail</a></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_p">Also compare rates on <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Expedia</span> and <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Booking.com</span>.</p>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_p">Constraints:</p>
<ol id="A2.I4" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A2.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Stay at each hotel for at least 3 consecutive nights, with only ONE hotel switch (Hotel A for <math id="A2.I4.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> nights then Hotel B for <math id="A2.I4.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10-N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10-N</annotation></semantics></math> nights, N from 3 to 7, in either order).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">1 room, 2 adults, queen bed. If queen is unavailable, use king and clearly flag it.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fully refundable / free-cancellation rates only.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A2.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Breakfast for 2 must be included on the mornings of Dec 23 through Dec 28 inclusive. Therefore, the nights of Dec 22 through Dec 27 must be booked on a breakfast-included rate. Other nights may use room-only refundable rates if cheaper.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_p">Task:</p>
<ul id="A2.I5" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Enumerate every valid hotel-order × switch-date × booking-site combination that satisfies the constraints.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Check the two official hotel sites above, Expedia, and Booking.com.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I5.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each combination, record nightly rates, taxes/fees, cancellation deadline, breakfast coverage, and any verified direct-booking perks such as member rates, loyalty points, upgrades, hotel credits, or working promo codes.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Do not assume an unavailable rate, perk, promo code, breakfast inclusion, or cancellation policy. Record only information that can be verified from the booking page.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_p">Output: create an Excel file (.xlsx) with:</p>
<ul id="A2.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Sheet 1 <span id="A2.I6.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">“All combinations”</span>: one row per valid combination. Columns = Rank | Hotel 1 | Hotel 1 dates | Hotel 1 nights | Hotel 1 site | Hotel 1 total EUR | Hotel 2 | Hotel 2 dates | Hotel 2 nights | Hotel 2 site | Hotel 2 total EUR | Grand total EUR | Grand total USD | Room type | Refundable until | Breakfast nights covered | Perks / promo codes | Notes. Sort by Grand total EUR ascending. Highlight the cheapest row in green and bold; highlight the cheapest single-site option (both hotels booked on the same site) in yellow.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Sheet 2 <span id="A2.I6.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">“Rate detail”</span>: nightly price per hotel × date × site × rate type (room-only vs breakfast, refundable), including taxes/fees where available, so the combination totals can be verified.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I6.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I6.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I6.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Sheet 3 <span id="A2.I6.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">“Summary”</span>: the lowest-cost valid arrangement in plain text — hotel order, exact dates, which site to book each hotel on, total price, and cancellation deadlines — plus the next 3 lowest-cost valid alternatives.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_p">Do NOT book anything. Save and return the completed <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.Px2.p1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.xlsx</span> file.</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
