<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We first present verbatim excerpts for code execution and harness-to-model decision transfer, then provide the complete OpenGCUA system prompt for the <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">all</span> setting. Only the environment login credential is redacted; the instructions and examples are preserved as recorded.</p>
</div>
