<section id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Harness-Managed Context.</h5>

<div id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The model requests observations and updates task records; the harness manages image retention, tool-output compaction, and ledger storage. The status <span id="A3.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">claimed_verified</span> records the model’s assessment, not independent verification. Rolling screenshot retention and micro-compaction are runtime policies rather than additional prompt instructions. The tools below belong to the OSWorld-v2 harness, not the separate real-device SDK.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
