<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Trajectory Examples</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present selected stages from successful GPT-6 Astra and
Claude Opus 5 runs under the full GCUA setting.
These models’ complete trajectories and visualizations are publicly available on GitHub.</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>GPT-6 Astra: Selecting and Verifying Slide Backgrounds</h3>

<section id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Task and Provenance.</h5>

<div id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Task 003 asks the agent to identify Hong Kong among numbered photos, select
usable rain and snow overlays, use GIMP to create two <math id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1920\times 1080" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1920</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>1080</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1920\times 1080</annotation></semantics></math>
composites, and apply them to the corresponding presentation slides at 40%
transparency without changing other slide content. This run contains 13
executed actions; its attempt identifier is
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">20260922_234150_f801c23a_c2d54d</span>. The recorded model is
<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gpt-6-astra</span>, with reasoning effort <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max</span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prepare an Observation and Choose the Assets (Steps 3–5).</h5>

<div id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Step 3 states: <em id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">“Show the extracted assets in an available image
viewer.”</em> Its code constructs labeled contact sheets, opens them in GIMP,
and calls <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">screenshot()</span>. The tool output also reports that
<span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">filter5.png</span> has alpha extrema <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(0, 190)</span>, distinguishing it
from opaque alternatives. Step 5 records the selected Hong Kong image and
filters with <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">todo.update</span>, then states: <em id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">“Create the rainy and
snowy composites in GIMP using the transparent rain and black-backed snow
overlays.”</em> These exact calls select Normal and Screen blending:</p>
