<p id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The same action’s output reports successful batch execution and both
requested PNGs at <math id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1920\times 1080" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1920</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>1080</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1920\times 1080</annotation></semantics></math>. Thus the observation is followed by
concrete editing calls and artifact checks.</p>
</div>
