<section id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Inspect the Saved Application State (Steps 7–11).</h5>

<div id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">After updating the presentation’s background XML and relationships in step 7,
the agent reopens it and inspects Slide Properties. Step 11 states:
<em id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">“Check the snowy slide’s background transparency using the same
properties panel.”</em> It selects the snowy slide, opens the transparency tab,
and calls <span id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">screenshot()</span>. The saved next observation shows the snowy
slide’s 40% transparency setting. This is a visual check of a particular
property, not the basis for the full-task score.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
