<div id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Step 12 states: <em id="A4.SS1.SSS0.Px4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">“Verify the saved files and preservation of slide
content, then leave the snowy slide visible.”</em> The program compares the
saved presentation with the original package, checks that only the expected
entries changed, checks the background transparency and embedded image
bytes, and verifies PNG dimensions and opacity. Selected assertions are:</p>
</div>
