<section id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Task and Provenance.</h5>

<div id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Task 045 asks for a GIF walkthrough of all seven sections of a local analytics
dashboard, recorded in fullscreen Chrome at <math id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1920\times 1080" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1920</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>1080</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1920\times 1080</annotation></semantics></math>. The recording
must last at least five seconds, exclude obstructing desktop elements, and
be saved as <span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_ref_self">Desktop/promo.gif</span> under 1 MiB without reducing resolution.
This run contains 14 executed actions; its attempt identifier is
<span class="ltx_ref ltx_nolink ltx_path ltx_font_typewriter ltx_ref_self">20260922_232028_bdc5bc85_31e0ce</span>. The recorded model is
<span id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">claude-opus-5</span>, with reasoning effort <span id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">max</span>.</p>
