inspects the site structure. A CDP viewport query in step 6 fails with
<span id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">403 Forbidden</span>; the transcript retains this failure. Step 7 states:
<em id="A4.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">“Record the 14-second screen capture with ffmpeg while clicking
through all 7 sidebar sections.”</em> It starts an X11 screen recording and
uses a loop over the seven named pages and their sidebar coordinates:</p>
</div>
